### ============================================
### ACCOUNT / STOCK VALIDATION TEST
### ============================================


### 0. DB RESET
# PostgreSQL에서 먼저 실행:
#
# TRUNCATE TABLE transactions, accounts, dividends RESTART IDENTITY CASCADE;


### 1. Create Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Account",
  "initialCash": 20000
}


### 2. Set AAPL Price = $100
POST http://localhost:8080/api/market/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 100
}


### 3. Buy 10 AAPL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 10
}


### 4. Portfolio
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/portfolio


### 5. Balance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/balance


### 6. Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions


### 7. Positions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/positions



### Sync AAPL Dividends
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dividends/sync/AAPL